{"title": "Adamantine Skin", "pageid": 6471, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Adamantine_Skin", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Adamantine Skin</b> is a passive feature of <a href=\"/wiki/Grym\" title=\"Grym\">Grym</a>. It renders Grym invulnerable to all types of damage until weakened with intense heat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Made entirely from adamantine, this mass is about as heavy as a dragon, and nearly as indestructible. Only intense heat can soften the metal enough to be shaped. \n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Slashing_Immunity.png/28px-Slashing_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Slashing_Immunity.png/42px-Slashing_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Slashing_Immunity.png/56px-Slashing_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Slashing_Immunity.png/28px-Slashing_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Slashing_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Piercing_Immunity.png/28px-Piercing_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Piercing_Immunity.png/42px-Piercing_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Piercing_Immunity.png/56px-Piercing_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Piercing_Immunity.png/28px-Piercing_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Piercing_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Bludgeoning_Immunity.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Bludgeoning_Immunity.png/42px-Bludgeoning_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Bludgeoning_Immunity.png/56px-Bludgeoning_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Bludgeoning_Immunity.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Bludgeoning_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Acid_Immunity.png/28px-Acid_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Acid_Immunity.png/42px-Acid_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Acid_Immunity.png/56px-Acid_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Acid_Immunity.png/28px-Acid_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Acid_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Thunder_Immunity.png/28px-Thunder_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Thunder_Immunity.png/42px-Thunder_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Thunder_Immunity.png/56px-Thunder_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Thunder_Immunity.png/28px-Thunder_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a hre