a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Lightning_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/28px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/42px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/56px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png/28px-Cold_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Cold_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Imm